# Managed by chezmoi. macOS only (see .chezmoiignore).
#
# Keep key passphrases in the macOS Keychain: the first time a passphrase is
# typed, ssh stores it there; after that it is unlocked with your login and
# the key is loaded into the agent on first use -- no more prompts, also after
# a restart.
Host *
  UseKeychain yes
  AddKeysToAgent yes
